Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.85,0:23:10.76,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\3c&H806947&}喉通ったフレイバーには
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.76,0:23:16.56,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H806947&}初めて知る感情あふれ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.56,0:23:25.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H806947&}あこがれも傷も全て　今
Dialogue: 2,0:23:25.34,0:23:32.68,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\3c&H806947&}溶け込んで　光る
Dialogue: 3,0:22:16.57,0:22:22.20,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&\fad(200,0)}水面的波纹上　那躲开的脸庞
Dialogue: 3,0:22:22.49,0:22:28.32,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}是我的心　想把荡漾藏起来
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.32,0:22:34.06,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}只要与你站在一起　我的心脏
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.56,0:22:38.46,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&\fad(300,500)}就炽热地跳个不停
Dialogue: 3,0:22:38.91,0:22:41.84,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&\fad(300,0)}醉颜　吐息　羞赧的你
Dialogue: 3,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.68,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}今晚做个好梦
Dialogue: 3,0:22:44.68,0:22:47.71,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}两袖相接　心潮涨落
Dialogue: 3,0:22:47.71,0:22:50.53,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}我看见你眼中的我
Dialogue: 3,0:22:50.53,0:22:53.45,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}就像要将深处的光芒
Dialogue: 3,0:22:53.45,0:22:57.22,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}浅尝一口那般
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.22,0:23:02.95,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}呼唤你的名字
Dialogue: 3,0:23:04.85,0:23:10.76,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&\fad(200,0)}滑过喉咙留下的气味
Dialogue: 3,0:23:10.76,0:23:16.56,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}洋溢着从未有过的感情
Dialogue: 3,0:23:16.56,0:23:25.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&}憧憬也好　受伤也罢　如今全部
Dialogue: 3,0:23:25.34,0:23:32.68,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\1a&HFF&\fad(0,200)}融入其中　熠熠生辉
